e.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FSnu-P-Cu6AHJh1CuGfl32Q\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Snu-P-Cu6AHJh1CuGfl32Q</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息102.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/ca/pim98mfinvu0zdjk1t1glm95gv5gt3d.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; float: left; width: 45%; margin-top: 0.2em; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; float: right; width: 45%; margin-top: 0.2em; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 0.3em; height: 0.3em; border-radius: 100%; margin: auto; background-color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin: 20px 0% 10px; text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; vertical-align: top; border-style: dotted; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(243, 204, 204); padding: 10px; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(250, 245, 245); box-shadow: rgb(100, 32, 32) 0px 18px 0px -14px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; margin: -22px 0% 10px; transform: translate3d(1px, 0px, 0px); display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: middle; flex: 100 100 0%; height: auto; padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; align-self: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"justify-content: center; margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; transform: translate3d(1px, 0px, 0px); display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; min-width: 10%; max-width: 100%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; background-color: rgb(243, 204, 204); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(100, 32, 32); padding-right: 6px; padding-left: 6px; align-self: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; margin: -1px 0%; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: middle; flex: 100 100 0%; align-self: center; height: auto; padding-right: 5px; padding-left: 5px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(243, 204, 204); border-top-left-radius: 0px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(243, 204, 204); border-bottom-right-radius: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); letter-spacing: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">马格努斯</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-left: 0%; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">伊利亚王国军元帅，忠诚坚韧的铁血军人，作战风格勇猛精通战略的宿将，是伊利亚“军魂”般的人物。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">马格努斯曾作为法里斯王的挚友和副手，为伊利亚的独立战争立下了汗马功劳，伊利亚建国后成为王国军统帅，并成为两位王子的军略战技老师。 &#160;</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 32, 32); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\">在法里斯王隐退后，马格努斯代表着法里斯王的意志辅佐迪塔利奥，继续保卫着伊利亚的和平。 &#160;</span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息142.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f7/qvcwnhp1rotlx0c8yinzl8fvfj3dvdw.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n</p>\n<center><small>*图片内容仅供参考，实际效果以游戏内为准</small></center>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息104.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4e/mqwclur2a71tay6w1t7e7sz1zexygzs.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163724\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2089/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 268/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100